# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we demonstrate the functionalities to augment the pool of electronic\n"
"configurations obtained by the action of transition operators on each electronic\n"
"configuration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita mendemonstrasikan fungsionalitas untuk memperbesar pool konfigurasi elektronik\n"
"yang diperoleh dari aksi operator transisi pada setiap konfigurasi\n"
"elektronik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We demonstrate how to add single-electron hops of the type:\n"
"$$\n"
"c^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} c_{q\\sigma} |\\textbf{x} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"for $p, q = 1, ..., N_\\textrm{orb}$ and $\\sigma \\in \\{ \\uparrow, \\downarrow\\}$,\n"
"and for all $|\\textbf{x} \\rangle$ in the batch of electronic configurations.\n"
"We start by generating a batch of random electronic configurations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita tunjukkan cara menambahkan lompatan satu elektron dengan tipe:\n"
"$$\n"
"c^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} c_{q\\sigma} |\\textbf{x} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"untuk $p, q = 1, ..., N_\\textrm{orb}$ dan $\\sigma \\in \\{ \\uparrow, \\downarrow\\}$,\n"
"serta untuk semua $|\\textbf{x} \\rangle$ dalam batch konfigurasi elektronik.\n"
"Kita mulai dengan membangkitkan batch konfigurasi elektronik acak:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The excitation operators are specified inside a numpy array whose length is\n"
"equal to the number of fermionic nodes (or qubits). Each element of the array\n"
"must be a string that can take values:\n"
msgstr ""
"Operator eksitasi ditentukan di dalam array numpy yang panjangnya\n"
"sama dengan jumlah node fermionik (atau qubit). Setiap elemen array\n"
"harus berupa string yang bisa bernilai:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'I'``: Identity\n"
msgstr "``'I'``: Identity\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'+'``: Creation operator\n"
msgstr "``'+'``: Operator pembentukan (creation)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'-'``: Annihilation operator\n"
msgstr "``'-'``: Operator peluruhan (annihilation)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We generate all possible single-electron transitions (amongst same spin\n"
"species).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita bangkitkan semua kemungkinan transisi satu elektron (di antara spesies spin\n"
"yang sama).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we apply the transition operators to the configurations in ``bitstring_matrix``:\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita terapkan operator transisi ke konfigurasi di ``bitstring_matrix``:\n"
